sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Device A
    participant B as Device B
    Note over A,B: BLE already connected from role resolution
    A->>A: create NISession, read discoveryToken tokenA
    B->>B: create NISession, read discoveryToken tokenB
    A->>B: send tokenA over handshake characteristic
    B->>A: send tokenB over handshake characteristic
    A->>A: run config with peerToken tokenB
    B->>B: run config with peerToken tokenA
    Note over A,B: both NISessions now live
    B-->>A: didUpdate NINearbyObject.distance
    A-->>B: didUpdate NINearbyObject.distance
    Note over A,B: distance below threshold, gate passes
